WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.606 --> 00:00:10.508
Uppfæra námskeiða- og stofulista:
what the survey page offers.

2
00:00:15.612 --> 00:00:23.268
Sækja óskir kennara fetches
the answers.

3
00:00:23.368 --> 00:00:28.516
New answers land in “athugasemdir”,
not yet processed.

4
00:00:28.616 --> 00:00:34.913
In Tímabókanir, this filter finds
courses with open answers.

5
00:00:35.013 --> 00:00:41.516
The teacher's tab is marked.

6
00:00:41.616 --> 00:00:47.521
“Fylla út úr könnun” (fill in from
the survey) copies the answer in.

7
00:00:47.621 --> 00:00:51.523
Check it, and change it
if needed.

8
00:00:51.623 --> 00:00:57.525
Afgreiða óskir: the wishes go
to the sessions, for Besta.

9
00:00:57.625 --> 00:01:03.895
In the session: the teacher's red
and green, N-132 as a last resort.
